{"4063380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stalker from Willowfield St.", "steam_appid": 4063380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Anomaly hunt observation duty</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those unfamiliar with the genre: Your goal is to explore the house on night 0 and remember your surroundings. Then, on each subsequent night, explore the house again and look for differences. They can be subtle like moved furniture, missing items or noticeable as broken windows or creepy gifts. If you find any of these, scan it and then call the police using the phone. Otherwise you go to sleep. However, if you see the stalker in your house don't scan anything and run to the front door and exit the house. Correct choice advances you to next night. Failure leads to death and puts you to the last checkpoint (or night 0 if playing on hardcore mode).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Scan for anomalies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find anything changed in the house, scan it. If you got it correct you can use the phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/38120c073acd9401692944a98ccc2a49.poster.avif?t=1777392574\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/38120c073acd9401692944a98ccc2a49.webm?t=1777392574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/38120c073acd9401692944a98ccc2a49.mp4?t=1777392574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Make correct choice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three choices outside of usual two:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you found an anomaly? Scan it and call 911!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you see the stalker in the house? Waste no time and run away through the main door!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything normal? Go to sleep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/587b89504bf296ef5e13713fd0432b71.avif?t=1777392574\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Interact with objects!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes anomaly may be triggered by interacting with objects. Like closet doors, lights, TV etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Feedback system</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed an anomaly and died? Check the newspaper for clues about what went wrong. No more endless searching for one sneaky change that blocks your progress forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do your chore!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each night, you may get some chore to do. Be sure to complete it and be observant during that as sometimes the anomaly may show only during the chore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unlock new areas</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As nights pass, new areas of the house become accessible.  More places to observe raise the difficulty slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiple Gamemodes</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular mode - a forgiving experience with checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard mode - no checkpoints, one mistake sends you back to start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare mode unlocks once you complete the game once. Endless nights with guaranteed unbeaten anomalies for completionists.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Anomaly hunt observation duty</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those unfamiliar with the genre: Your goal is to explore the house on night 0 and remember your surroundings. Then, on each subsequent night, explore the house again and look for differences. They can be subtle like moved furniture, missing items or noticeable as broken windows or creepy gifts. If you find any of these, scan it and then call the police using the phone. Otherwise you go to sleep. However, if you see the stalker in your house don't scan anything and run to the front door and exit the house. Correct choice advances you to next night. Failure leads to death and puts you to the last checkpoint (or night 0 if playing on hardcore mode).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Scan for anomalies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find anything changed in the house, scan it. If you got it correct you can use the phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/38120c073acd9401692944a98ccc2a49.poster.avif?t=1777392574\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/38120c073acd9401692944a98ccc2a49.webm?t=1777392574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/38120c073acd9401692944a98ccc2a49.mp4?t=1777392574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Make correct choice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three choices outside of usual two:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you found an anomaly? Scan it and call 911!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you see the stalker in the house? Waste no time and run away through the main door!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything normal? Go to sleep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/extras/587b89504bf296ef5e13713fd0432b71.avif?t=1777392574\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Interact with objects!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes anomaly may be triggered by interacting with objects. Like closet doors, lights, TV etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Feedback system</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed an anomaly and died? Check the newspaper for clues about what went wrong. No more endless searching for one sneaky change that blocks your progress forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do your chore!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each night, you may get some chore to do. Be sure to complete it and be observant during that as sometimes the anomaly may show only during the chore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unlock new areas</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As nights pass, new areas of the house become accessible.  More places to observe raise the difficulty slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiple Gamemodes</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular mode - a forgiving experience with checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard mode - no checkpoints, one mistake sends you back to start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare mode unlocks once you complete the game once. Endless nights with guaranteed unbeaten anomalies for completionists.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A stalker is terrorizing the neighborhood, and you’re next. Watch for signs he’s been inside your house and make the right choices to avoid becoming his next victim. Test your observation skills in this Exit 8-style game where the threat isn’t supernatural, but a real man and you have three choices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/32e41b8fbc025c611a5134141bf9b6ef12028a54/header.jpg?t=1777392574", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/a4a904a18d30cff2b0b88df78df8a789bbc6f332/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777392574", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063380/a4a904a18d30cff2b0b88df78df8a789bbc6f332/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777392574", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i7 4770 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<s